","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、お母さんは\n「やっぱり割れた~！でも型が悪かったよ！笑」って言われました。。(ToT)\n厳しいよぅ~お母さん  (´д｀|||)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが写メ撮ってたら入ってきたよ♪可愛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘーイ今回の取り扱い説明書メンバーは〜〜〜〜川後ひなちゃ〜んっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁさぁそれではさっそくやりましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前\n川後ひな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特技\nオタ活、アニメ、アイドル、かわいい子大好きでなんでも調べること！めっちゃ詳しくて図鑑みたい\n(みなさん知ってると思いますが毒舌です！はい。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癖\nアヒル口"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意な物真似\n桐谷美玲さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"性格\nさっぱりしていて、大人っぽい！\n15歳だけど、38歳くらい\n←結構真剣に考えたw\nそして弱音もあまりはかないので、\n強い\n強い\n強い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！以上です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校のこととか色々心配してくれたり、いつも構ってくれて嬉しいですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n絶大美女"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上から一枚目二枚目は個別握手会で着た服です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/0005.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23日は、らんぜちゃんの誕生日だったね~"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年の らんぜちゃん♪\n素敵な１年になりますように(*^▽^)/★*☆♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではスマイル＆happyに行きましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援ありがとうございます(*^^*ゞ\n皆にも まあやの応援が届きますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE "},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0001.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-32781":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n 花粉症になってしまったのか\n でもまだ認めたくない自分もいて\n 花粉症のお薬を飲んで症状が治ったら\n それは花粉症だという事を認めている気がして\n なかなか一歩が踏み出せません。\n \n でもきっと私は今年から花粉症です。\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n \n \n 昨日は金曜日！\n MUSIC STATIONさんに\n 出演させていただきました！！\n 年齢で出演できないひなのの分まで\n 頑張りましたよ〜⚫️🔻⚫️\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39EFV0B65P04GN762SX4AG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39EKEX1WAP0Y57BQ45ATWP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n ソンナコトナイヨー！\n 叫んでくれましたか😚？\n \n \n 新衣装でした〜\n 今回も本当にとっても可愛い🧚‍♀️\n しかも、ちっちゃくハサミが描いてある\n 生地なんです🥺🥺見つけられるかな〜？\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39EMGSTTGKJR9ZJJG4W72S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39ENKY8H46C5H6J3X9EK2B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n クールあんぽんたん！\n \n \n そして、ひなたの励まし企画として、\n 東京スカパラダイスオーケストラの\n GAMOさんを励まさせていただきました！\n \n トランペットを吹いていた身としては\n 東京スカパラダイスオーケストラさんは\n もう憧れのずっと昔から曲を聞いたり\n パフォーマンスを見させていただいてた存在なので\n 本当に光栄でしたし、\n とっても緊張しました、、、\n \n \n でも皆さんお優しくて\n とても素敵な体験になりました🥺\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39EPQVQY0Z10DVMYAXASJX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n お写真まで🥺\n スタジオで生パフォーマンスを観れたこと\n 一生忘れません！！\n \n \n \n \n トランペットが吹きたくなりました、、、😊\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39EQRMMEB3QKET9BDHDS13","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 新しいロゴのティッシュ初めていただきました💗\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 今日はTGCです！\n 残念ながら無観客開催になってしまいましたが、\n TGC30回記念ということで！\n 画面越しで盛り上がっていただけると\n 嬉しいです🧚‍♀️💗\n \n よろしくお願いします！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39ERSF9YN1RDDW5REDRNY2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ39ESSY3838C618VQ10KXVH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-26662":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n こんばんは(*^^*)♪\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20FF6Q4GASWB71D41NV43X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n よしっ！書くぞ😙\n \n \n \n \n \n まずは昨日の個別握手会のことから。\n \n 聞いてください！みーぱんこれから、1部、2部、3部とかで服装変えたりするけど1日ひとコーデずつブログに写真載せていこうかなって考えてます‪⸜(*ˊᵕˋ*)⸝‬\n \n \n \n \n \n だからまずは1部から。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20FG5NZ60SPJPBBP81XC21","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20FH5QDBYC3SAAHGT16JPN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n このポーズ実はいつもあんぱんを持ってます🙂\n \n ちなみにこしあんです！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ20FJ9910FKWSFY9SAY0S2N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 京都が思いのほか寒かったので、1部は上着をきました。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 来てくださったみなさん、\n \n ありがとうございました！！\n \n \n \n やっぱり握手会は楽しいなーっていつも思う。\n \n あとね、ソロ曲が大好きですとか声が好きですって方があまりに多くてびっくり。\n \n \n そんな褒めてくれるのただただ嬉しい限りです！😌\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そして今日お仕事とか学校とかお疲れ様です。⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᗜ'๑⃙⃘)⸝\n 月曜日は1週間の始まり。\n \n \n また1週間がんばるぞ〜😘👍🏻\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-28885":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n こんにちは(*^^*)♪\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22ZH7XPPYXRM385WW0E91D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22ZJTF4C0TA55FHJJKNSCM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 令和になりましたね〜！！\n \n なんか平成が終わってしまったと思うと悲しくなるよね、、。\n \n 変な感じだな！まさか年をまたぐとは思ってなかった👀\n \n \n \n \n \n あとあと平成の目標だった、マグロ一本釣りも果たせなかった😥😭\n \n よし！それは令和に持ち越しですね！！頑張るぞ！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そして令和さんこんにちは😊😊\n \n 令和さんには勝手に縁があると思っててね、令和って決まってからお母さんがね、\n \n \n みれいわやーーん！ってメールしてきて、それでお気に入りになりました😳\n \n \n \n \n \n 令和でもよろしくお願いします！！😌\n \n \n \n \n     ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+\n \n \n \n \n 全国握手会で頂いたお花です！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22ZM9KQEAE6NPBS7M3SP19","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22ZNB9FTF0PMX1B9HSRH00","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22ZPBSF2NWV8M8PRZSAAYJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ22ZQDQY029PQVNNCY9SR4G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 嬉しい〜🥰🥰\n \n お花を届けて下さってありがとうございます😚\n \n 愛を受け取ったよ〜σ(´∀ ｀●)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n それではゴールデンウィーク、お休みの方はゆっくり休んでね！！\n \n お仕事だーって方は一緒に頑張ろう💪🏻😙\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7782":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/13/3640239/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうの言葉やアドバイス、心にしみましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんから言ってもらったこと忘れないように頑張るぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今もう4thに向けてのリハーサルが進んでいて\n日々筋肉痛"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/13/3640239/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しいけど、やればやるほど反省点が見つかったり工夫してみたり\nすご