e":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202302/mobdX0Zzx.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202302/mob9h50cn.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"　これは嵐山の竹林。また旅したい🎶"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202302/mobwL6RIx.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"　なぎにとっていい一年になりますように〜！！すきすき！　"}],"source":"official"}}